 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In the middle of Oakvale,",
   "s": 0.12,
   "e": 1.355
  },
  {
   "text": "there's a rusty lever,",
   "s": 1.519,
   "e": 2.64
  },
  {
   "text": "and the whole town is built around it.",
   "s": 2.966,
   "e": 4.773
  },
  {
   "text": "Every street curls toward it in a giant spiral.",
   "s": 5.387,
   "e": 8.252
  },
  {
   "text": "And there's one rule.",
   "s": 8.815,
   "e": 9.802
  },
  {
   "text": "Never,",
   "s": 10.203,
   "e": 10.842
  },
  {
   "text": "ever pull it.",
   "s": 11.188,
   "e": 12.118
  },
  {
   "text": "Guards watch it day and night.",
   "s": 12.633,
   "e": 14.361
  },
  {
   "text": "But Nora thinks it's ridiculous.",
   "s": 14.989,
   "e": 16.586
  },
  {
   "text": "So she digs through her grandpa's attic,",
   "s": 17.003,
   "e": 18.747
  },
  {
   "text": "and finds the founders' map.",
   "s": 18.883,
   "e": 20.235
  },
  {
   "text": "The streets aren't streets.",
   "s": 20.902,
   "e": 22.453
  },
  {
   "text": "They're drains.",
   "s": 22.774,
   "e": 23.635
  },
  {
   "text": "Oakvale sits right on top of a dried-up river.",
   "s": 24.097,
   "e": 26.562
  },
  {
   "text": "She shows the mayor.",
   "s": 27.191,
   "e": 28.012
  },
  {
   "text": "He laughs her out of the room.",
   "s": 28.503,
   "e": 29.78
  },
  {
   "text": "Then one spring,",
   "s": 30.399,
   "e": 31.655
  },
  {
   "text": "it rains for nine days straight.",
   "s": 31.845,
   "e": 33.854
  },
  {
   "text": "Up in the hills, the old river wakes up.",
   "s": 34.406,
   "e": 36.497
  },
  {
   "text": "A wall of water roars straight at the town.",
   "s": 37.106,
   "e": 39.741
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone runs.",
   "s": 40.221,
   "e": 41.167
  },
  {
   "text": "Nora runs the other way,",
   "s": 41.553,
   "e": 42.755
  },
  {
   "text": "right past the guards,",
   "s": 42.934,
   "e": 43.999
  },
  {
   "text": "and yanks the lever.",
   "s": 44.13,
   "e": 45.094
  },
  {
   "text": "Deep underground, giant stone gates grind open.",
   "s": 45.682,
   "e": 48.983
  },
  {
   "text": "The flood hits the spiral, spins around every house like water down a sink,",
   "s": 49.449,
   "e": 53.483
  },
  {
   "text": "and vanishes under the square.",
   "s": 53.76,
   "e": 55.133
  },
  {
   "text": "Not one house floods.",
   "s": 55.69,
   "e": 57.336
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "s": 57.869,
   "e": 58.246
  },
  {
   "text": "the founders never fought the river.",
   "s": 58.456,
   "e": 60.148
  },
  {
   "text": "They built the town to swallow it.",
   "s": 60.62,
   "e": 62.311
  },
  {
   "text": "And here's the crazy part.",
   "s": 62.822,
   "e": 63.913
  },
  {
   "text": "The rule was never \"don't pull it.\"",
   "s": 64.322,
   "e": 66.198
  },
  {
   "text": "It was \"don't pull it,",
   "s": 66.604,
   "e": 67.946
  },
  {
   "text": "until you need it.\"",
   "s": 68.195,
   "e": 69.191
  }
 ]
}